1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,311
Everybody asks who made the pelau.

2
00:00:02,311 --> 00:00:05,709
Your black cake is gone before the speeches start.

3
00:00:05,709 --> 00:00:08,631
Right now people find you through a cousin,

4
00:00:08,631 --> 00:00:10,942
a church group or a WhatsApp chat.

5
00:00:10,942 --> 00:00:14,000
Sweet Hand is a new way for them to find you.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,198
Sweet Hand opens soon in Toronto and the GTA.

7
00:00:17,198 --> 00:00:20,183
Jamaican, Trini, Guyanese, Bajan and more,

8
00:00:20,183 --> 00:00:23,594
all in one place, so people planning a birthday,

9
00:00:23,594 --> 00:00:28,000
a wedding or a christening can find someone with a sweet hand.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,447
On launch day you get your own page.

11
00:00:30,447 --> 00:00:33,845
Your photos, your menu, the islands you cook from,

12
00:00:33,845 --> 00:00:37,515
the areas you serve and the size of event you take on.

13
00:00:37,515 --> 00:00:39,621
People see the areas you serve.

14
00:00:39,621 --> 00:00:42,000
We never ask for your home address.

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,932
People browse by island, area and occasion.

16
00:00:44,932 --> 00:00:46,909
When they like what they see,

17
00:00:46,909 --> 00:00:50,523
they send an enquiry with their date and guest count.

18
00:00:50,523 --> 00:00:54,341
You reply, and you agree the details directly with them.

19
00:00:54,341 --> 00:00:57,000
Listing is free, and there are no fees.

20
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,557
To be listed you'll need a food handler certificate,

21
00:01:00,557 --> 00:01:04,046
and our team checks every page before it goes live.

22
00:01:04,046 --> 00:01:06,714
Joining the launch list takes a minute.

23
00:01:06,714 --> 00:01:09,723
Go to sweethand.ca, press Join as a caterer,

24
00:01:09,723 --> 00:01:12,323
add your business name and your email,

25
00:01:12,323 --> 00:01:14,580
and confirm the link we send you.

26
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:17,043
We'll email you once, on launch day.

27
00:01:17,043 --> 00:01:19,389
Sweet Hand. Your sweet hand, found.
